Thanks to the hard work of our Homeland Security Investigations and our interagency law enforcement partners, Sarah Root’s killer, who fled the US to evade prosecution, will finally face justice.

Senator Joni Ernst has been a champion for Sarah and her family. Her efforts and leadership were crucial in this extradition. 

